Pinpoint: public domain dedication
==================================

The Pinpoint engine (engine/), build tools (tools/), and the hand-compiled
place lists in packs/ are dedicated to the public domain by
Jonathan Trouern-Trend under Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal.

To the extent possible under law, the author has waived all copyright and
related or neighboring rights to this work. You may copy, modify,
distribute and perform the work, even for commercial purposes, all
without asking permission.

Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

Third-party material in this repository keeps its own terms and is NOT
covered by the dedication above:

- City lists derived from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org): CC BY 4.0.
  Keep the GeoNames credit shown on the start screen.
- Outlines from Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com): public domain.
- US outlines from the US Census Bureau, packaged as us-atlas and
  world-atlas by Mike Bostock: public domain data, ISC-licensed packaging.
- D3 and topojson-client are loaded from public CDNs (ISC) and are not
  included in this repository.
